# Dataroma sentiment chart

After any change to the sentiment algorithm (`src/sources/dataromaSentiment.js`)
or its plot app, run `plotDR` (require/run `src/apps/plotDR.js`) so the HTML
chart opens in the browser via `openInBrowser`. Do this before finishing the
turn — do not wait for the user to ask.
